https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A9LpsP0goJ8  (Capo 0)

This version is from the live 2002 concert in Barcelona.  The studio version is also available.  The live version has an intro, the studio version does not. 

TIP:  If transposing, play the root chord of the (CaddD) and add the 9th note if necessary.

TIP:  You can play the intro by picking the individual notes (notes may or may not transpose) or strumming chords.  Both are pretty simple.  For notes (untransposed):  Form (C) and pick the open 3rd string <g>, then the covered 2nd string <c>, now put your pinky on the 2nd string/3rd fret <d> and pick, lift off and pick again <c>.  That's it.  For chords it's three single-strums of (C) and then you add your pinky to the 2nd string/3rd fret for one strum and then one more strum of (C).  Either way, do this sequence eight times and hit the (F) that begins the song.
  

